\t\t<p><strong>Conference:</strong> DayOne Innovation Showcase 2026</p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p><strong>Date:</strong> December 15, 2026</p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p><strong>Location:</strong> Novartis Campus, Basel, Switzerland</p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p><strong>Booth:</strong> TBD</p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p>Proud Visibility Partner</p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div><div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" id=\"fws_6afb824c3e39d\" style=\"padding-top: 24px;\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<a class=\"nectar-button large see-through-2 \" href=\"#Meet\" style=\"margin-right: 15px; margin-bottom: 12px; border-color: #ffffff; color: #ffffff;\"><span>Meet us there</span></a>\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row full-width-section  bottom_margin_40px\" id=\"Resources-Full-width-text-with-optional-button\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"><div class=\"inner-wrap row-bg-layer\"><div class=\"row-bg viewport-desktop\"></div></div></div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding padding-4-percent_tablet no-extra-padding_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" id=\"fws_6afb824c3e837\" style=\"padding-bottom: 16px;\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column no-extra-padding force-desktop-text-align-left no-extra-padding_tablet no-extra-padding_phone \" style=\"color: #ffffff;\">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading Source-serif-text\" style=\"font-size: 30px; color: #212b3b; line-height: 34px; text-align: left;\">From Breakthrough Innovation to Trusted Evidence</h2>\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div><div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" id=\"fws_6afb824c3ea66\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column no-extra-padding no-extra-padding_tablet no-extra-padding_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p><strong>Drug Discovery and Development Solutions for Every Phase</strong></p>\n<p>Transforming promising science into successful therapies requires more than innovation. It takes the right evidence, development strategy, and regulatory expertise to make confident decisions at every stage.</p>\n<p>Join Certara at the <strong>DayOne Innovation Showcase 2026</strong>, where biotech founders, healthcare innovators, investors, and pharmaceutical leaders come together to explore the future of healthcare innovation.</p>\n<p>Certara combines predictive biosimulation, AI-enabled technologies, integrated drug development solutions, and regulatory expertise to help emerging companies and investors reduce uncertainty, optimize development strategies, and advance promising innovations.</p>\n<p>Whether you&#8217;re preparing for your next funding milestone, evaluating an investment opportunity, or advancing a therapeutic program, Certara can help you make informed decisions that drive development forward.</p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row full-width-section  bottom_margin_40px\" id=\"Resources-Full-width-text-with-optional-button\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"><div class=\"inner-wrap row-bg-layer\"><div class=\"row-bg viewport-desktop\"></div></div></div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding padding-4-percent_tablet no-extra-padding_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" id=\"fws_6afb824c3ed7e\" style=\"padding-bottom: 16px;\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column no-extra-padding force-desktop-text-align-left no-extra-padding_tablet no-extra-padding_phone \" style=\"color: #ffffff;\">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading Source-serif-text\" style=\"font-size: 30px; color: #212b3b; line-height: 34px; text-align: left;\">Advancing Innovation. Reducing Risk. Creating Value.</h2>\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div><div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" id=\"fws_6afb824c3eefc\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column no-extra-padding no-extra-padding_tablet no-extra-padding_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p>Certara helps innovators and investors navigate complex drug development decisions with greater confidence.</p>\n<h3>Reduce Development Risk</h3>\n<p>Identify scientific, clinical, and regulatory challenges earlier through predictive modeling, integrated development planning, and evidence-driven decision-making.</p>\n<h3>Make Capital Work Harder</h3>\n<p>Focus resources on the right opportunities by optimizing development strategies, informing study design, and prioritizing investments that support critical milestones.</p>\n<h3>Build Investor and Partner Confidence</h3>\n<p>Generate credible scientific evidence and executable development strategies that strengthen investment readiness, support partnering discussions, and demonstrate asset potential.</p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row  bottom_margin_40px zindex-set\" id=\"fws_6afb824c3f10e\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"><div class=\"inner-wrap row-bg-layer\"><div class=\"row-bg viewport-desktop\"></div></div></div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col left_padding_desktop_32px top_padding_desktop_32px right_padding_desktop_32px bottom_padding_desktop_32px \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"column-bg-overlay-wrap column-bg-layer\"><div class=\"column-bg-overlay\" style=\"background-color: #faf7f7;\"></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" id=\"fws_6afb824c3f252\" style=\"padding-bottom: 16px;\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column no-extra-padding force-desktop-text-align-left no-extra-padding_tablet no-extra-padding_phone \" style=\"color: #ffffff;\">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading\" style=\"font-size: 30px; color: #212b3b; line-height: 34px; text-align: left;\">Meet Certara's Experts at DayOne</h2>\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div><div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" id=\"fws_6afb824c3f3bb\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column no-extra-padding no-extra-padding_tablet no-extra-padding_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p>Connect with our team to discuss how Certara&#8217;s integrated scientific, regulatory, and technology capabilities can help advance your innovation, strengthen your development strategy, and support your next milestone.</p>\n<p><strong>Rik de Greef, </strong>Senior Vice President, Global Quantitative Sciences Services, Certara Drug Development Solutions</p>\n<p><strong>Philippe Salphati,</strong> Sr. Director, Strategic Partnerships &amp; Growth</p>\n<p><strong>Diane Garvey, </strong>Portfolio Account Director, Certara AI, EMEA</p>\n<p><strong>Jurgen Grampp,</strong> Global Account Director</p>\n<p><strong>Renaud Feix,</strong> Global Portfolio Director</p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row vc_row-o-equal-height vc_row-flex vc_row-o-content-top  top_margin_80px bottom_margin_40px\" id=\"Meet\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"><div class=\"inner-wrap row-bg-layer\"><div class=\"row-bg viewport-desktop using-bg-color\" style=\"background-color: #f1edec;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row vc_row-o-equal-height vc_row-flex vc_row-o-content-top\" id=\"fws_6afb824c3f66c\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-4 CTA-form-explainer-text wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column padding-3-percent inherit_tablet padding-5-percent_phone \" style=\"color: #ffffff;\">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"column-image-bg-wrap column-bg-layer viewport-desktop\"><div class=\"inner-wrap\"><div class=\"column-image-bg\"></div></div></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading Source-serif-text vc_custom_1794855713203\" style=\"font-size: 30px; color: #ffffff; line-height: 34px; text-align: left;\">Let's Connect at DayOne</h2>\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p>Meet with Certara&#8217;s experts to explore how we can help reduce development risk, strengthen investment readiness, and accelerate your next milestone.</p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-8 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column left_padding_desktop_24px top_padding_desktop_24px right_padding_desktop_24px bottom_padding_desktop_40px \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"wpb_raw_code wpb_raw_html wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row full-width-section  bottom_margin_40px\" id=\"Resources-Full-width-text-with-optional-button\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"><div class=\"inner-wrap row-bg-layer\"><div class=\"row-bg viewport-desktop\"></div></div></div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding padding-4-percent_tablet no-extra-padding_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" id=\"fws_6afb824c3fc82\" style=\"padding-bottom: 16px;\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column no-extra-padding force-desktop-text-align-left no-extra-padding_tablet no-extra-padding_phone \" style=\"color: #ffffff;\">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading Source-serif-text\" style=\"font-size: 30px; color: #212b3b; line-height: 34px; text-align: left;\">Explore Our Resources</h2>\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div><div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" id=\"fws_6afb824c3fe14\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column no-extra-padding no-extra-padding_tablet no-extra-padding_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p>Discover how Certara helps emerging biotechs, investors, and pharmaceutical innovators reduce development risk, build investment-ready programs, and make informed scientific and strategic decisions.</p>\n<p><strong>Bio Venture Catalyst</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Accelerating Development. Strengthening Investment Readiness.</strong></p>\n<p>Explore how Certara helps emerging biotech companies develop integrated strategies that support funding, development milestones, and long-term asset value.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/services/bio-venture-catalyst/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Explore Bio Venture Catalyst</a></p>\n<p><strong>Due Diligence and Asset Evaluation</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Make More Informed Investment Decisions.</strong></p>\n<p>Discover how Certara supports venture capital firms, private equity investors, and pharmaceutical partners with independent scientific, clinical, regulatory, and commercial asset evaluations.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/services/due-diligence-and-asset-evaluation/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Explore Due Diligence and Asset Evaluation</a></p>\n<p><strong>Model-Informed Drug Development (MIDD)</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Make More Confident Drug Development Decisions.</strong></p>\n<p>Discover how Certara&#8217;s model-informed drug development solutions integrate predictive modeling, clinical pharmacology, and regulatory expertise to optimize development strategies, inform dose selection, and support evidence-driven decisions across the drug development lifecycle.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/solutions/midd/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Explore Certara&#8217;s MIDD Solutions</a></p>\n<p><strong>Pharmacometrics Services</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Transform Clinical Data into Actionable Development Insights.</strong></p>\n<p>Explore how Certara&#8217;s pharmacometrics experts leverage population PK/PD modeling, exposure-response analysis, and clinical trial simulation to inform dosing strategies, optimize study design, and strengthen regulatory decision-making.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/services/pharmacometrics/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Explore Certara&#8217;s Pharmacometrics Services</a></p>\n<p><strong>What It Takes to Build a Fundable Biotech</strong></p>\n<p><strong>On-Demand Investor Panel</strong></p>\n<p>Hear perspectives on what investors look for in emerging biotech companies and how scientific credibility, development planning, and investment readiness influence funding decisions.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/on-demand-webinar/investor-panel-what-it-takes-to-build-a-fundable-biotech-with-life-science-nation/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Watch the Webinar</a></p>\n<p><strong>Building IND-Ready and Investor-Ready Development Programs</strong></p>\n<p><strong>On-Demand Webinar</strong></p>\n<p>Learn how integrated development planning can help emerging biotech companies navigate regulatory requirements, manage risk, and prepare for critical investment and clinical milestones.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/on-demand-webinar/building-ind-ready-and-investor-ready-development-programs/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Watch the Webinar</a></p>\n<p><strong>MIDD as a Tool to Enhance Asset Value and Address Key Investor Concerns</strong></p>\n<p><strong>On-Demand Webinar</strong></p>\n<p>Explore how model-informed drug development can strengthen scientific evidence, inform development strategy, and support investment and licensing decisions.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/on-demand-webinar/midd-as-a-tool-to-enhance-asset-value-and-address-key-investor-concerns/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Watch the Webinar</a></p>\n<p><strong>Portfolio Prioritization Using Early-Stage Biosimulation and QSP</strong></p>\n<p><strong>On-Demand Webinar</strong></p>\n<p>Discover how quantitative systems pharmacology and predictive modeling can help evaluate therapeutic opportunities, prioritize assets, and guide early development investment decisions.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/on-demand-webinar/portfolio-prioritization-for-large-and-small-pharma-using-early-stage-biosimulation-qsp/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Watch the Webinar</a></p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.certara.com/conference/dayone-innovation-showcase-2026/\">DayOne Innovation Showcase 2026</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.certara.com\">Certara</a>.</p>"
      }
